----------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA & PRIVACY
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

User data and intervals.icu connection tokens are stored under the local
directory ~/.domestique/ (intentionally unchanged from the upstream project
so existing data and connections survive upgrades without migration).
No training data leaves the local machine except to intervals.icu when the
user explicitly authorizes the connection.

